OL,3,GNEWSAMural on shop wall celebrates
OL,4,Acommunity heritage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community-inspired mural celebrating
OL,7,Fits history, residents and nature has
OL,8,Fbeen created on the side of a shop in
OL,9,FYork.
OL,11,FPreviously a plain brick wall, the
OL,12,Fspace on Lowther Street in The Groves
OL,13,Fnow shows images of a fox wearing a
OL,14,Fcap, apples and the city's famous Bile
OL,15,FBeans advertisement.
OL,17,FThe project was funded by the Vibrant
OL,18,Fand Sustainable High Street Fund
OL,19,Fthrough the York and North Yorkshire
OL,20,FCombined Authority.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
