OL,3,GNEWSAMural on shop wall celebrates
OL,4,Acommunity heritage
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal street artist Tom Sledmore, who
OL,7,Fspent about a week painting the mural,
OL,8,Fsaid it has brought the community
OL,9,Ftogether and "brightens the place up".
